{"step_index":113,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:21:31+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:21:31+08:00\nShowing lines 155-183 of 183\n155: ### 复现命令\n156: \n157: ```bash\n158: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\n159: \n160: # 1. 贴图 + 环境 + 动画 + 白模工程\n161: python pipeline/gen_textures.py\n162: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_env.py\n163: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_anim.py\n164: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_clay.py\n165: \n166: # 2. 快速渲染全部 26 镜头 1080p 剧照与拼图（约 1 min，无需重渲 2161 帧）\n167: \"$B\" -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_stills.py -- --render\n168: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_clay.py -- --render-stills\n169: \n170: # 3. 合成遥测引擎声浪并封装成片\n171: python pipeline/synth_sfx.py\n172: bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh --sfx-only\n173: bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh --sfx-only\n174: ```\n175: \n176: ---\n177: \n178: ## 8. 边界说明\n179: \n180: - **平面高程**：OSM 赛道中心线 `z=0`；银石本身为二战机场改建赛道、地势平坦，如需厘米级起伏需额外叠加 LiDAR DEM 数据。\n181: - **单车计时圈**：当前为单台 F1 飞驰排位圈（Qualifying Hotlap），不含多车缠斗与进站换胎动画。\n182: - **遥测拟合精度**：速度剖面与 8 档引擎转速由真实弯道曲率与下压力抓地力包线推演，视听节奏与真实银石杆位车载高度吻合，但并非某一场官方 ECU 原始采样。\n183: - **数据许可**：赛道中心线源自 OpenStreetMap（ODbL），公开发布请署名 `© OpenStreetMap contributors`。"}
