equirements, the script must extract precise audio windows for each clip with sample accuracy, incorporating crossfades and specific dimensional glitch effects at the transitions. The goal is now to build the correct audio with precise sample count to align with the visual clips' timing, while also incorporating all the desired sonic events.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nV6 SPIDER-VERSE EDITION — Stylized Multiverse Telemetry SFX & Master Mix\\n========================================================================\\n100% V5 Isolation:\\n  - Reads track_data/silverstone_track.json, pipeline/v5_anim.py,\\n    renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav, and renders_v5/audio_v5_90s.m4a READ-ONLY.\\n  - Writes ONLY to renders_v6/:\\n      * renders_v6/sfx_spiderverse_90s.wav   (48 kHz, 16-bit stereo, 90.0417 s)\\n      * renders_v6/audio_v6_sv_mix_90s.m4a   (48 kHz, stereo AAC 256k, TP <= -1.0 dBFS)\\n\\n3-Act Across-the-Spider-Verse Sonic Architecture:\\n  - Act I   (f=1..788,    Earth-1610 Miles): Graphic comic mid-punch, 12fps On-Twos\\n            harmonic pulse, snappy vinyl-scratch & comic whip-crack upshift transients,\\n            + f=312..313 (t=12.958s) Village Hairpin 2-frame Impact Hit & Sub-Bass Drop.\\n  - Portal 1->2 (f=788..791) & Portal 2->3 (f=1601..1604):\\n            Multiverse Dimensional Glitch (reverse riser + tape-stop + 5-bit/6.8kHz\\n            decimated CMYK stereo pitch-tear + whip arrival).\\n  - Act II  (f=789..1601, Earth-65 Gwen): Lush dual-LFO stereo chorus + octave-up\\n            crystalline watercolor shimmer tail on high-RPM exhaust & pass-bys +\\n            Earth-65 punk-kit brush/cymbal accents on beat cuts.\\n  - Act III (f=1602..2161, Earth-928 2099): Menacing Spider-2099 / Prowler-inspired\\n            5-voice detuned F-minor distorted cyber-brass synth growl under throttle +\\n            colossal f=1698..1699 (t=70.708s, Stowe 331 km/h braking) 2099 Siren +\\n            2-frame rhythmic buffer stutter + Seismic F1 Sub-Bass Impact Drop!\\n\\nUsage:\\n  python pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py\\n  python pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py --reel-wav <temp_reel_12s.wav>\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport argparse\\nimport math\\nimport os\\nimport subprocess\\nimport sys\\nimport tempfile\\nimport time\\nimport wave\\n\\nimport numpy as np\\nfrom scipy import signal\\n\\nPROJ = r\\\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\"\\nFFMPEG = r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\86052\\\\scoop\\\\shims\\\\ffmpeg.exe\\\"\\n\\n# Read-on\n<truncated 32405 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"d:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\pipeline\\\\synth_sfx_sv.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking","tool_calls"]}
